---
description: FastAPI and SQLModel skills for Python changes
paths:
  - "{{ package_name }}/**/*.py"
---

When a change depends on current FastAPI or SQLModel behavior, load the `fastapi` and
`sqlmodel` skills rather than relying on model priors; they track the versions this project
pins. Install them with `npx skills add fastapi/fastapi` and `npx skills add fastapi/sqlmodel`.
